    "notes": [
      "Higher Unreal Z is farther from the viewer: priority = -floor(feet_Z_cm + 0.5). Gameplay base 0 and 1 priority unit per cm match the player Blueprint.",
      "Unreal stores translucent sort priority as signed int16 inside FPrimitiveSceneProxy. Every compiled priority must remain in [-32768,32767]; int32 editor properties alone do not prove effective rendering order.",
      "Draw anchors follow collision foot/base centers. When an authored footprint is moved, update its matching depth anchor.",
